{"id":"b9311b45-48ae-4ba1-8cce-bbaaca8866fb","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"01d262f84e41bb4b","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/terminal/index.ts","baseline":{"blob":"19dbb6ef8c21b381c8972cf1e8627341c6927ffb","start":12647,"end":12828},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","setLine","=","(","next",":","string",")",":","void","=>","{","fire","(","\"","\\","\\b","b","\"",".","repeat","(","pos",")","+","\"","\\","\\x1B[0K","x","1B","\"","+","next",")",";","line","=","next",";","pos","=","next",".","length",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"66a907a5aec9e7e6","after":"62161212561726b8"}},"payload":{"text":"A small line editor over `line`/`pos` — cursor movement (←/→, Home/End, Ctrl-A/E), in-place insert/delete, and\n↑/↓ command history. Redraws are done with bare escapes: `\\b` (cursor left), `\\x1b[C` (cursor right),\n`\\x1b[0K` (erase to end of line). After an in-place edit we reprint the tail and step the cursor back onto it.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:08:54.900Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:08:54.900Z"}
